  "vector_memory": {
    "semantic_summary": "MeshRendererBehaviour is a specialized renderer responsible for drawing complex 3D geometry utilizing Physically Based Rendering (PBR) techniques. It manages the entire rendering pipeline for mesh entities, including setting up shadow maps, handling advanced lighting calculations (directional, point, spot), and integrating material properties like normal, roughness, and AO maps. It heavily relies on WebGL2 context manipulation and caches performance-critical data structures to ensure efficient rendering performance."
  },
